# 基础词 Unit22
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-基础词
# 描述: 基础词Unit22核心词汇

{{forever}}{/fərˈevər/}}adv. 永远}}{{Nothing lasts forever in this world.}}
{{forget}}{/fərˈɡet/}}v. 忘记；忽略}}{{I forgot to bring my umbrella today.}}
{{forgive}}{/fərˈɡɪv/}}v. 原谅；宽恕}}{{Please forgive me for arriving late.}}
{{form}}{/fɔːrm/}}n. 形式；表格；v. 形成}}{{Please fill out this form and return it to us.}}
{{formal}}{/ˈfɔːrml/}}adj. 正式的；形式上的}}{{The invitation specifies that the dress code is formal.}}
{{former}}{/ˈfɔːrmər/}}adj. 以前的；前者的}}{{The former president gave a speech at the conference.}}
{{formula}}{/ˈfɔːrmjələ/}}n. 公式；方案}}{{The mathematical formula is used to calculate the area.}}
{{forth}}{/fɔːrθ/}}adv. 向前；向外}}{{From that day forth, everything changed.}}
{{fortune}}{/ˈfɔːrtʃuːn/}}n. 命运；财富}}{{He made a fortune in the stock market.}}
{{forward}}{/ˈfɔːrwərd/}}adv. 向前；adj. 前进的}}{{The team is looking forward to the championship game.}}
{{found}}{/faʊnd/}}v. 建立；发现}}{{The company was founded in 1990.}}
{{foundation}}{/faʊnˈdeɪʃn/}}n. 基础；基金会}}{{Education is the foundation of a successful career.}}
{{frame}}{/freɪm/}}n. 框架；结构；v. 构造}}{{She put the painting in a beautiful wooden frame.}}
{{free}}{/friː/}}adj. 自由的；免费的；v. 释放}}{{The museum offers free admission on Sundays.}}
{{freedom}}{/ˈfriːdəm/}}n. 自由；自主}}{{Freedom of speech is a basic human right.}}
{{freeze}}{/friːz/}}v. 冻结；冰冻}}{{The lake freezes over during the winter months.}}
{{frequent}}{/ˈfriːkwənt/}}adj. 频繁的；经常的}}{{Frequent exercise helps maintain good health.}}
{{fresh}}{/freʃ/}}adj. 新鲜的；清新的}}{{The market sells fresh fruits and vegetables every morning.}}
{{friend}}{/frend/}}n. 朋友}}{{A true friend is someone you can always rely on.}}
{{frighten}}{/ˈfraɪtn/}}v. 使害怕；使惊恐}}{{The loud noise frightened the children.}}
{{front}}{/frʌnt/}}n. 前面；adj. 前面的}}{{The teacher stood at the front of the classroom.}}
{{fruit}}{/fruːt/}}n. 水果；成果}}{{Eating fresh fruit is good for your health.}}
{{frustrate}}{/frʌˈstreɪt/}}v. 使沮丧；挫败}}{{The lack of progress frustrated the entire team.}}
{{fuel}}{/ˈfjuːəl/}}n. 燃料；v. 加燃料}}{{The car runs on a cleaner type of fuel.}}
{{fulfill}}{/fʊlˈfɪl/}}v. 实现；履行}}{{She fulfilled her dream of becoming a teacher.}}
{{full}}{/fʊl/}}adj. 满的；完整的}}{{The theater was full on opening night.}}
{{fun}}{/fʌn/}}n. 乐趣；adj. 有趣的}}{{We had a lot of fun at the amusement park.}}
{{function}}{/ˈfʌŋkʃn/}}n. 功能；函数；v. 运作}}{{The main function of the heart is to pump blood.}}
{{fund}}{/fʌnd/}}n. 基金；资金；v. 资助}}{{The research was funded by the government.}}
{{fundamental}}{/ˌfʌndəˈmentl/}}adj. 基本的；根本的}}{{Honesty is a fundamental value in any relationship.}}
{{funeral}}{/ˈfjuːnərəl/}}n. 葬礼；丧礼}}{{The funeral was attended by hundreds of people.}}
{{funny}}{/ˈfʌni/}}adj. 有趣的；滑稽的}}{{He told a funny joke that made everyone laugh.}}
{{furniture}}{/ˈfɜːrnɪtʃər/}}n. 家具}}{{The new furniture was delivered to the house yesterday.}}
{{further}}{/ˈfɜːrðər/}}adj./adv. 更远的；进一步地}}{{We need to discuss this matter further.}}
{{future}}{/ˈfjuːtʃər/}}n. 未来；adj. 未来的}}{{Technology will play a big role in the future.}}
{{gain}}{/ɡeɪn/}}v. 获得；n. 收获；利润}}{{She gained valuable experience from the internship.}}
{{gallery}}{/ˈɡæləri/}}n. 画廊；美术馆}}{{The art gallery displays works by local artists.}}
{{game}}{/ɡeɪm/}}n. 游戏；比赛}}{{The basketball game was very exciting to watch.}}
{{gap}}{/ɡæp/}}n. 缺口；差距}}{{The gap between the rich and the poor is widening.}}
{{garage}}{/ɡəˈrɑːʒ/}}n. 车库；修车厂}}{{He parked his car in the garage overnight.}}
